251
00:21:09,220 --> 00:21:12,260
That is exactly what the CLIO projection solves.

252
00:21:12,860 --> 00:21:14,900
Reality is impossibly high-dimensional.

253
00:21:15,480 --> 00:21:17,980
It is structurally too massive to compute.

254
00:21:18,300 --> 00:21:18,400
Right.

