00:21:47,960 --> 00:21:52,580
the distance between the financial bank and the river bank remains proportionally correct.

265
00:21:52,820 --> 00:21:53,260
Exactly.

266
00:21:53,420 --> 00:21:57,460
It preserves the shape of the labyrinth, even if it blurs the texture of the walls.

